# What git ignores and still changes a result on the same code, for the build queue's memory of failures (tools/sysguard/heavy.sh).
# PDFium, which tools/pdfium.sh puts in target/.
target/pdfium
# Settings that change what a test does, each by name: a run with another is another run. Never a prefix: RECTO_QA_OWNER_PID, RECTO_STATE_DIR,
# RECTO_FUZZ_STATE and nextest's own NEXTEST_* differ on every run, and would make every run new, so a failure would never be remembered.
# The slow mode and its older switches.
env RECTO_QA_SLOW
env RECTO_QA_RESTORE_DELAY_MS
env RECTO_QA_REMAKE_DELAY_MS
# Whether the app tests run, and whether a missing app fails them.
env RECTO_REQUIRE_APP
env RECTO_SKIP_APP
# Which worker, library and helper the tests run against.
env RECTO_TEST_WORKER
env RECTO_RENDER_SERVICE
env RECTO_PDFIUM_LIB
# How much is run: every PDF indexed, fuzz rounds and seed, a long session's rounds.
env RECTO_INDEX_ALL
env RECTO_FUZZ_ROUNDS
env RECTO_FUZZ_SEED
env RECTO_LONG_SESSION_ROUNDS
# Real files read by the optional tests.
env RECTO_BENCH100
env RECTO_MARKS_PAGES
env RECTO_ENCRYPTED_PDF
env RECTO_ENCRYPTED_PASSWORD
env RECTO_CHROME
# The build and the test runner's settings.
env NEXTEST_PROFILE
env RUSTFLAGS
